%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: LukaIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Sorry, here's the form. I think I put the wrong date on it. Luka
      Tsereteli. I'm ten. I live upstairs in Block C, fourth floor, with my mum.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: School stopped two weeks ago. My teacher said it was temporary. She
      hasn't come back.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Is your school still open?
      npcResponse: No. They locked the gates. I waited outside for a while in
        case someone came. Nobody came.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    - playerChoiceText: What year are you in?
      npcResponse: Fourth year. I was supposed to do my reading test this month.
        I practiced a lot for it.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I live with my mum. My dad's in Varka for work. She keeps trying
      to call him but the phones don't connect. I keep telling myself it's going
      to be fine.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: My hands keep shaking and I can't tell if it's the cold or something
      else. My papers are fine. I double-checked after the last time I forgot
      them.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Is there anything that helps?
      npcResponse: Routine. Coming through here is part of it, weirdly. At least
        this part is predictable.
      animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    - playerChoiceText: You should try to sleep.
      npcResponse: I know. I just can't make my brain quiet enough. I'm working
        on it.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
